//! The device tree blob efiboot fills in from the ACPI tables (`efiacpi.rs`) when the
//! firmware has no device tree: `dt_blob_start`, the template of `acpi.dts` as
//! `dtc -p 16384 -H epapr -O asm` writes it (`make update-blob`), followed by 16 KB of room
//! for the nodes and properties efiboot adds.
//!
//! Upstream: sys/arch/arm64/stand/efiboot/dt_blob.S @ 3ce1f3f79392,
//! sys/arch/arm64/stand/efiboot/acpi.dts @ 3ce1f3f79392
//!
